{"sections":[{"slug":"圆","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"圆"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">圆</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“圆”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在同伦类型论中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">圆</span> $S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">是如下</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶归纳类型","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶归纳类型</span>"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一个点</span> $\\mathsf{base} \\colon S^1$,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一条道路</span> $\\mathsf {loop}\\colon \\mathsf {base}=\\mathsf {base}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对任意类型</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $x\\colon A$, $p\\colon x=x$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个映射</span> $f\\colon S^1\\to A$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $f(\\mathsf {base})\\equiv x$, $f(\\mathsf {loop})\\equiv p$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. $\\mathsf {loop}\\neq \\mathsf {refl}_{\\mathsf {base}}$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">假设</span> $\\mathsf {loop}=\\mathsf {refl}_{\\mathsf {base}}$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么对任意类型</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $x\\colon A$, $p\\colon x=x$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个映射</span> $f\\colon S^1\\to A$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $f(\\mathsf {base})\\equiv x$, $f(\\mathsf {loop})\\equiv p$, <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span> $p=f(\\mathsf {refl}_{\\mathsf {base}})=\\mathsf {refl}_x$. <span lang=\"zh\">这说明任意类型都是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/集合","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">集合</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span>)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}